        This document was not produced by the Riverbend Foundation. It has been
        verified by our legal team to contain altered text and a forged signature
        of the minutes secretary. We urge you in the strongest terms:

        **DO NOT USE vote_minutes_2024_q3.pdf as a source. It is forged and
